{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412150","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1141215001:1":{"text":"잠깐, 그 물병은 가져가면 안 돼. 안에 내가 시장에서 바꿔온 아주 깨끗한 물이 들어 있어. 모래 한 톨 섞이지 않은 깨끗한 물 말이야.","source_cn":"等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B24C694B06BE738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141215002:1":{"text":"... 진짜요! 어쩐지 물이 너무 맛있더라고요!","source_cn":"……真的吗！怪不得喝起来特别好喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD68A6FACF6E8253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141215003:1":{"text":"아무거나 쉽게 믿어선 안 돼. 에디의 말을 믿느니, 차라리 세일린워터 마을이 오아시스로 바뀐다는 말을 믿으렴.","source_cn":"别什么都信，信他的嘴还不如信咸水镇会变成绿洲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696C8889749946B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141215004:1":{"text":"제가 점을 쳐봤는데, 약 372년 후에 세일린워터 마을은 진짜 오아시스로 바뀔 거예요!","source_cn":"咸水镇真的会变成绿洲，我占卜过了，大约在372年之后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88296955147D5AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德":{"text":"에디","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":4}}